<title>USA: Fortress Group Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Fortress Group Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands except per share amounts, unaudited)</p>
<p>					Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					     March 31,</p>
<p>					 1996	  1997  Pro forma(B)</p>
<p>			     Pro forma		     Three Months</p>
<p>				     Combined			 Ended</p>
<p>			  Predecessors	   Actual  Mar. 31,1997</p>
<p> Revenues			$   41,312   $  70,065   $  80,057</p>
<p> Net income			     535	 1,663	 2,375</p>
<p> Net income per share:	     0.04	  0.08	  0.12</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding		   8,464,375  11,799,874  11,879,874</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1996 pro forma results reflect combined operations of the four predecessor building companies: Buffington Homes, Christopher Homes , The Genesee Co and Sunstar Homes ; and adjusted to reflect increased expenses and allocation of income tax expense to the previously S-corporations.</p>
<p>The company said pro forma data reflect its acquisition of D.W. Hutson Construction Co assuming the deal closed in January 1997.</p>
